  "date": "2026-10-21",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "支付机构开始清理“睡眠账户”",
  "title_en": "Payment companies start clearing out “dormant accounts”",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "据报道，今年一些第三方支付机构开始清理“睡眠账户”。睡眠账户指的是很长时间没有登录、也没有支付活动的账户。网易支付在4月发布公告，会分批清理连续12个月没有登录的个人账户。",
      "en": "According to reports, this year some third-party payment institutions have started clearing out “dormant accounts”. Dormant accounts are accounts that have not been logged into and have had no payment activity for a long time. In April, NetEase Pay issued a notice saying it will clear, in batches, personal accounts that have not been logged into for 12 consecutive months."
    },
    {
      "zh": "美的支付也在7月和9月先后发布公告，清理两年或更长时间没有交易、没有资金往来、也没有登录的商户账户和个人账户。财付通虽然没有发布专门的清理公告，但是更新了用户协议，增加了客户风险分级和动态监测等内容。",
      "en": "Midea Pay also issued notices in July and September, one after another, to clear merchant and personal accounts with no transactions, no fund flows and no logins for two years or more. Tenpay did not publish a dedicated cleanup notice, but it updated its user agreement, adding content such as customer risk tiering and dynamic monitoring."
    },
    {
      "zh": "监管部门要求支付机构做好客户身份管理和账户管理。",
      "en": "Regulators require payment institutions to do a good job of managing customer identities and accounts."
    },
    {
      "zh": "对用户来说，如果想保留账户，只需要重新登录，然后更新身份信息。账户里有余额或者有没完成的交易，一般不会被直接关闭，用户仍然可以取回资金。",
      "en": "For users, keeping an account only requires logging in again and then updating identity information. Accounts with a balance or unfinished transactions are generally not closed directly, and users can still get their money back."
    }
  ],
